    "description": "This course will cover the history, theory and practice of letterforms and\n\ntypography as they apply to graphics, advertising and other areas of design and\n\nvisual communication. Projects cover typography history, principles of\n\ntypography, letter structure, typeface selection, fundamentals of computer\n\ntypesetting.",
    "studentTasks": "Attend at least 80% of contact hours in order to be accepted to the final examination\n\n- Actively participate in class activities\n\n- Fulfill tasks given by instructor after class\n\n- Use their own laptop in class only for learning purpose\n\n- Read the textbook in advance\n\n- Access the course website (www.cms.fpt.edu.vn) for up-to-date information and material of the course, for online supports from teachers and other students and for practicing and assessment.\n\n- Complete course's Portfolio with full contents of exercises and submit to the teacher 1 day after the course.",
